## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical use of Cloud Functions, Storage triggers, DLP redaction basics, BigQuery logging, and idempotency via insertId, all in a beginner context with minimal IAM and retry considerations.

## Key Concepts

- Cloud Functions finalize triggers
- Cloud DLP redaction basics
- GCS path handling and idempotent writes
- BigQuery insertId for deduplication
- IAM least privilege and retry policies

